        <li><h3>Master 2 - Fluid mechanics</h3><p><strong>Ecole Polytechnique &amp; Sorbonne University</strong></p><p>Obtained a Master's degree in fluid mechanics. Courses followed : Hydrodynamic instabilities, Advanced experimental methods, Numerical methods for fluid mechanics, Geophysical and astrophysical fluid dynamics, Multiscale hydrodynamic phenomena, Turbulence dynamics, Aerodynamics, Interfaces</p><time>September 2023 – July 2024</time></li>
